# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets / sessions — NEVER commit these
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Playwright persistent context = your logged-in WhatsApp session (auth
# cookies/tokens) + browser cache. Sensitive and huge.
playwright_session/
playwright_session/**
*.session
.env
.env.*
secrets.json
credentials.json

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Large binaries (exceed GitHub's 100 MB limit; keep locally)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
